# 🇮🇳 JharSetu — n8n Workflow

JharSetu is a digital platform that transforms citizen-reported community problems into structured civic challenges and connects them with relevant institutions and expertise.

This repository contains the **n8n workflow** responsible for complaint intake, AI analysis, database processing, institution matching, notifications, and Telegram integration.

---

## 🎯 Purpose

The n8n workflow acts as the **orchestration layer** of JharSetu.

It connects:

```text
Citizen
   ↓
Complaint
   ↓
AI Analysis
   ↓
Structured Information
   ↓
MySQL Database
   ↓
Institution Matching
   ↓
Notification
   ↓
Collaborative Problem Solving
